     Exactly one of cc, rr, tt, uu, or xx must appear, selecting the
     function to perform; the remaining letters are modifiers.
     Any following arguments are _f_i_l_e operands, added to, ex-
     tracted from, listed against, or updated in the archive; if
     none are given, cc and rr operate on the current directory
